  "excerpt_en": "IV near the top of its own 1-year range—prime territory for premium sellers who harvest mean reversion.",
  "body_en": "<!-- ===== OptionsAji 博客片段：高 IV Rank 榜使用说明 ===== -->\n<style>\n  .aji-guide{--bg:#f5f2f0;--ink:#151617;--gold:#c9a227;--card:#fffdfb;--line:#e7e1d8;--muted:#6f6a63;--soft:#c9c2b6;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;padding:4px}\n  .aji-guide h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}\n  .aji-guide h3{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 8px;font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide p{margin:10px 0}.aji-guide .lead{font-size:17px}\n  .aji-guide .accent{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide .chart-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(21,22,23,.05)}\n  .aji-guide .chart-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 14px}\n  .aji-guide canvas{max-width:100%}\n  .aji-guide .analogy{border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(201,162,39,.07);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin:16px 0}\n  .aji-guide .formula{background:#151617;color:#f5f2f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;overflow-x:auto}\n  .aji-guide .formula b{color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:14.5px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px}\n  .aji-guide .data-table th{background:var(--ink);color:#f5f2f0;text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:600}\n  .aji-guide .data-table td{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}\n  .aji-guide .data-table tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(201,162,39,.035)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table .col{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}\n  .aji-guide .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px}\n  .aji-guide .tag-core{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}.aji-guide .tag-base{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .disclaimer{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .aji-guide .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(201,162,39,.3);transition:background .15s}\n  .aji-guide .cta:hover{background:#b8911f}\n  .aji-guide .cta-row{margin:16px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom{background:rgba(201,162,39,.08);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0 8px;text-align:center}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom p{margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aji-guide\">\n  <h2>Understanding the High IV Rank Board: Priciest Options, Best for Sellers</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Contracts whose <span class=\"accent\">implied vol sits near their own historical highs</span>. IV Rank compares IV to its <b>1-year range</b>—a favorite screen for <b>sellers</b>.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-row\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/high-iv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live High IV Rank board →</a></div>\n  <h3>1. IV vs IV Rank</h3>\n  <div class=\"analogy\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>IV</b> = market pricing of future volatility (absolute).</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>IV Rank</b> = where today's IV sits in its own 52-week range (0–100)—like temperature vs <b>your</b> normal baseline.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"formula\">IV Rank = (current IV − 1y low) / (1y high − 1y low) × 100<br><b>Ex</b>: IV 55%, range [25%, 65%] → <b>75</b></div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">IV Rank Leaders (example)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Gold = IV Rank &gt; 70 (seller-friendly). Rendered with Chart.js via jsDelivr CDN only.</p><canvas id=\"ivrTop\" width=\"640\" height=\"300\" aria-label=\"IV Rank chart\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>2. Why Sellers Like High IV Rank: Mean Reversion</h3>\n  <p>IV tends to <span class=\"accent\">spike then fade</span>—especially around earnings (<b>IV Crush</b>). Sellers collect rich premium, betting on vol compression.</p>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">IV Around Earnings</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">IV rises into the event, collapses after—the seller's window.</p><canvas id=\"ivrCrush\" width=\"640\" height=\"280\" aria-label=\"IV crush chart\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>3. Column Guide</h3>\n  <table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Column</th><th>Meaning</th><th>How to use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">#</td><td>Rank by IV Rank.</td><td>Relatively \"expensive\" options.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Contract / Symbol</td><td>Underlying or contract.</td><td>Check for catalysts.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">IV</td><td>Current implied vol.</td><td>Absolute premium level.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">IV Rank <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>IV vs 1y range (0–100).</td><td><span class=\"accent\">&gt;70 = elevated</span>, seller-friendly.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">IV Percentile</td><td>% of days IV was lower.</td><td>Confirms rank; robust to outliers.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">HV</td><td>Historical realized vol.</td><td>IV &gt;&gt; HV → rich premium.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Chg <span class=\"tag tag-base\">Aux</span></td><td>Day change.</td><td>Pair with direction.</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n  <h3>4. Three Reminders</h3>\n  <p><b>1. High IV Rank = expensive, not directional.</b> Consider credit structures.<br><b>2. Expensive for a reason</b>—size and use spreads.<br><b>3. Buyers beware IV Crush</b> at extremes.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-bottom\"><p>Ready to explore? See today's live data 👇</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/high-iv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live High IV Rank board →</a></div><p class=\"disclaimer\">Data may be delayed ~15 minutes. For research only—not investment advice. Options trading involves substantial risk of loss. © OptionsAji</p>\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  if(typeof Chart==='undefined')return;\n  var GOLD='#c9a227',GOLD_SOFT='rgba(201,162,39,.85)',GRAY='#c9c2b6',INK='#151617';\n  var labels=['SMCI','COIN','TSLA','NVDA','AAPL'];var ivr=[96,82,88,71,45];\n  var c1=document.getElementById('ivrTop');\n  if(c1){new Chart(c1,{type:'bar',data:{labels:labels,datasets:[{label:'IV Rank',data:ivr,backgroundColor:ivr.map(function(v){return v>70?GOLD:GRAY;}),borderRadius:4}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{display:false},tooltip:{callbacks:{label:function(i){return 'IV Rank '+i.parsed.y+(i.parsed.y>70?' (high)':'');}}}},\n    scales:{x:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{max:100,ticks:{color:INK},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'},title:{display:true,text:'IV Rank (0–100)',color:INK}}}}});}\n  var days=['-6','-5','-4','-3','-2','-1','Earnings','+1','+2','+3'];var iv=[31,33,36,40,47,58,60,32,29,28];\n  var c2=document.getElementById('ivrCrush');\n  if(c2){new Chart(c2,{type:'line',data:{labels:days,datasets:[{label:'ATM IV %',data:iv,borderColor:GOLD,backgroundColor:'rgba(201,162,39,.12)',fill:true,tension:.3,pointRadius:3}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{display:false},tooltip:{callbacks:{label:function(i){return 'IV '+i.parsed.y+'%';}}}},\n    scales:{x:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{ticks:{color:INK,callback:function(v){return v+'%';}},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}}});}\n})();\n</script>\n<!-- ===== /片段结束 ===== -->"
}
